. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Respondents with 1 or more daughters will be more likely than respo
> ndents without daughters to self-rate as more left-leaning. 
.         * We run a OLS regression with plh0004 as our dependent variable and 
> the dummy variable d_daughter as independent variable.
.         * As specified in the PAP, the model controls for the number of child
> ren, the gender of the respondent and the year of birth.
.         * We also specified a one-sided test  for the coefficient on d_daught
> er in the PAP.
. 
